                    <h3 style="color:var(--primary); margin-bottom:16px;">New / Trainee Diver — £25<span style="font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:400;">/month</span></h3>
                    <a href="https://pay.gocardless.com/BRT00024B1DKQ5E" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="padding:10px 32px; color:#ffffff !important;">Set Up Direct Debit</a>
                </div>
